WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.975
Who does what?

2
00:00:00.975 --> 00:00:04.405
The platform owner fills
the settings, collects,

3
00:00:04.405 --> 00:00:07.750
plans, applies, and does
the manual portal steps.

4
00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:10.286
A second person, from the change board,

5
00:00:10.286 --> 00:00:13.312
approves each plan's hash
and each rollback's.

6
00:00:13.312 --> 00:00:17.864
The policy owner approves the decision
records and the ring's desired state,

7
00:00:17.864 --> 00:00:22.199
and passes the enforce switch when a
policy's report-only period is clean.

8
00:00:22.199 --> 00:00:26.355
The technical program manager runs
the rings and keeps the ring record,

9
00:00:26.355 --> 00:00:28.750
and the service owner approves each exit.

10
00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:33.562
The security officer keeps each stage's
evidence folder, inside the boundary.

11
00:00:33.562 --> 00:00:35.500
No one approves their own change.
